{"story":{"id":"story-f6934acdf4be246c","title":{"zh":"他们是[This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural]！","en":"They are [This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural]!"},"category":"society","image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","start":"first_contact.101","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"当我们开始翻译这些所谓的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]进一步送达的通讯消息，我们惊讶地发现：他们讲的正是我们自己语言的一类方言！在惊讶消退之后，通讯极为迅速地建立了起来，他们现在被正式称为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]。","en":"As we began to intercept further communications from the so-called [This.ContactCountry.GetName], a startling discovery was made: they were speaking in a strange dialect of one of our own languages! Once the surprise of this encounter was overcome, communicati"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact.101"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact.101","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.101","title":{"zh":"他们是[This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural]！","en":"They are [This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural]!"},"texts":[{"zh":"当我们开始翻译这些所谓的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]进一步送达的通讯消息，我们惊讶地发现：他们讲的正是我们自己语言的一类方言！在惊讶消退之后，通讯极为迅速地建立了起来，他们现在被正式称为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]。","en":"As we began to intercept further communications from the so-called [This.ContactCountry.GetName], a startling discovery was made: they were speaking in a strange dialect of one of our own languages! Once the surprise of this encounter was overcome, communications were swiftly established, revealing them to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]."},{"zh":"我们在准备攻击[This.ContactCountry.GetName]时有了一个了不得的发现：他们竟然是[This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural]！当我们发现他们正在说着我们的一种陌生方言的时候，敌对行为立即被取消并且快速建立了联系，这表明了他们其实是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]。","en":"As we stood poised to attack the [This.ContactCountry.GetName], a remarkable discovery was made: they are [This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural]! Once we realized that they were speaking a strange dialect of one of our own languages, hostilities were called off and communications were swiftly established, revealing them to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"兴奋——我们找到了自己失落的同族！","en":"Rejoice - for we have found our lost kin!"},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"希望我们之间的血缘纽带能够导向友谊。","en":"Hopefully our kinly ties will lead to friendship."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"也许我们应该继续攻击他们……","en":"Perhaps we should still attack them..."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"亲情并不一定就意味着友情。保持警惕。","en":"Kinship doesn't imply friendship. Stay vigilant."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-03b48b046e84a703"},{"target":"first_contact.1105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-f4810be797c73d62"},{"target":"first_contact.1110","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-4c442c803066d8b5"},{"target":"galactic_features.387","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_fruitful"},{"target":"cara.1020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-d7b8fcad4ef27504"},{"target":"cara.2020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-c9b49b23ac539406"},{"target":"cara.3020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-2bb89e85cc3f8c94"},{"target":"marauder.15","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"origin_heirs_of_the_khan"},{"target":"leviathans.102","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-80b79499ff487797"},{"target":"leviathans.301","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.295","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3d8f3e9fe3ee2201"},{"target":"leviathans.502","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-7955ff16d7a36494"},{"target":"enclave.20